{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1000_p", "source_sha256": "49ddbeb89183614e1ceabdb6ed275eb436128b4c731aed562fdb6264f8d064f5", "ja": "（真美の新しい衣装が届いた。\n早速フィッティングをしてもらっているが……）", "zh": "（真美的新服装送到了。\n虽然已经马上让她试穿了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1001_p", "source_sha256": "97742959a1e7582376c8b496603cb9560e9f1fe98f9ab9dca3882270148a3604", "ja": "真美、お疲れさま。新しい衣装はどうだ？　\nサイズとか着心地とか、問題無いか？", "zh": "真美，辛苦了。新衣服感觉怎么样？\n尺寸、穿着感什么的，都没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "7bf7247dc699247ef9af80536c776f08074f4e1d22c4038682455f3e31bbd879", "ja": "あ、兄ちゃん！　もちろん、問題無いよん！\nピッタリンコでバッチリンコって感じ♪", "zh": "啊，哥哥！当然没问题啦！\n尺寸刚刚好，穿起来也棒棒的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6d75aac21112f4ec2906114613202681bba0b095bac2e65f5328c329ff459283", "ja": "よかった。よく似合ってるぞ。\n真美のイメージにピッタリの衣装だよな。", "zh": "太好了。真的很适合你。\n这套服装和真美的形象完全相称呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "5a6018920b13c169376a40456877fb61ef0c8f6235e7f4fa5e22fd7d58bec2ab", "ja": "うん！　あ、そうそう兄ちゃん。真美さ、この衣装\n着たら、なりたいものができちゃったんだー。", "zh": "嗯！　对了对了，哥哥。真美穿上这身衣服后，突然有了想成为的目标呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1005_p", "source_sha256": "dcf15baa12c1f81cab22b361ff9217e55af9ddb46e10a952ac2f9d880de5ece9", "ja": "……ん、なりたいもの？", "zh": "……嗯，想成为的目标？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "25fef7b053bf1f6192a317948ea1437581b97650e0f579de49bd0b99f7802ef3", "ja": "真美、この衣装を着て\n『スーパースター』になりたいんだよねー。", "zh": "真美想穿上这身服装，成为“超级明星”呢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c59098c83d30876765735668ec649d2d4f64f06bdd99ecfddfb20f776f5b506d", "ja": "す、スーパースター？　\nどうしたんだ、急にスケールの大きな話を……。", "zh": "超、超级明星？  \n怎么突然说起这么宏大的目标……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "09d662137a35b0f38361942d26524a2a9270bc05de39a613f03f14baadf6b3ca", "ja": "だってこの衣装、メッチャすぺーしーって感じじゃん！\n星、光ってるじゃん！　宇宙、感じちゃうじゃん！", "zh": "因为这套服装，感觉超有宇宙范儿嘛！\n星星在闪闪发光嘛！让人不由得感受到宇宙嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "6650788b6efa2259ba6c9a0456a6a6ca737f9a3d6cfbc3c08702cd1b171dab1a", "ja": "宇宙……そして、光る衣装……つまり。\n真美は、スーパーなお星さまってことなんだよ！", "zh": "宇宙……然后，发光的服装……也就是说。\n真美其实就是超级闪亮的星星啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5702a9fd81194f3f6fc1b3e5d2323928a9837ef8a6f2019a9b1d07dd4ce523bc", "ja": "……よくわからんが、わかった！　星っぽい衣装\nだから、スーパースターになりたいわけだな！", "zh": "……虽然不太懂，但我明白了！因为是像星星一样的服装，\n所以你才想成为超级巨星对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "1bc2fb30f273d3b7aff348d88bafacc1a8627eb11e676dde962ba9f9bb589b5e", "ja": "その通り！　この衣装をもらったってことは、\n真美に、スターになれってお告げなんだと思うよ！", "zh": "没错！能拿到这套服装，\n我觉得这就是在告诉真美，要成为明星！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "1b4f22b39fd0b82eca54a745c49e8662dd4a3529f87bb1b9314693f5083c2599", "ja": "だからだから……真美、劇場のみんなから\nスターのゴクイを習うことを決めたんだー！", "zh": "所以说所以说……真美决定要向剧场的大家学习成为明星的秘诀啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ce3b3fa76d084a5a7c2a2e8cc2bba0c12029eb2314d75b94458adc99a18b7f1e", "ja": "スターの極意……？　なんだかすごいな。\n試しに、どんなことを習うのか聞いてもいいか？", "zh": "明星的秘诀……？听起来很厉害啊。\n我能问问你打算学习哪些东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "197b4455dbac1a62c1dfa0b83ecbce0ea744c8077edfd93ab2c24a24e1ba38d4", "ja": "うんとねー、まずはあずさお姉ちゃんに、どうしたら\nそんなせくしーボディになれるのか聞くでしょ？", "zh": "嗯——首先要问问梓姐姐，怎样才能拥有那样性感的身材，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1015_p", "source_sha256": "75c96bcd8e1456b0d2c9e7060f43bb72768964bb529c0d59d83c93b63e1eac07", "ja": "（…………ん？）", "zh": "（…………嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "f6d31395eba44187959af9ddd4208da1ef3ee985d45cfa30a389797082ff34d6", "ja": "あとはみなりんに料理、みずきんに手品を習ったり、\n昴くんに変化球の投げ方を教えてもらったり……。", "zh": "然后跟美奈奈学做菜、跟瑞希希学魔术，\n再让昂教真美投变化球……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "82fab1f69b9d763f0ce20c6828cc631d748c35040872ba2ceb82f94341495455", "ja": "朋花様からカリスマのヒケツを聞いたり……。\nそうして51人から、スターのゴクイを手に入れて～。", "zh": "还从朋花大人那里听来了魅力四射的秘诀……。\n就这样从51个人那里，得到了明星的极意～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "ddc2e3c9ea70e1ca59cdd1d6414864ed9a4643a346a71a63fb4a9eab227c00ff", "ja": "ついに真美は、すべてを兼ね備えたスーパーなスターに\nなってしまうのだ☆　どうどう、完璧な作戦っしょ？", "zh": "真美终于要变成无所不备的超级明星了☆　怎么样怎么样，这可是完美的计划吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1019_p", "source_sha256": "54fc8e42811d42295040ac3c61bda73a6384a7aa19a07863a6864fe20da9aa46", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。方向性はどうあれ、努力することは\n悪いことじゃないし……まあその、頑張ってくれ。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……不管方向对不对，努力总不是什么坏事……总之，那就加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0194_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0194_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fb0e85192e82d05b80729526553674fd8b8b2502fb489f77e27b2f427f74efae", "ja": "（スターの極意というか何というか……まあ、やる気を\n持つのはいい事だろう。側で見守っていかないとな）", "zh": "（该说是成为明星的秘诀，还是该说什么呢……不过，有干劲总归是件好事。看来我得在旁边守望着她才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
